WrapperToken::constructor
├── when rollOverBot is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
└── when rollOverBot is valid address
    ├── when underlyingToken is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
    └── when underlyingToken is valid address
        ├── it should set rollOverBot
        ├── it should emit RollOverBotSet
        ├── it should set underlyingToken
        ├── it should emit UnderlyingTokenSet
        ├── it should set DECIMALS from underlying token metadata
        ├── it should set exchangeRate to 10 ** DECIMALS
        ├── it should emit ExchangeRateUpdated
        ├── it should set ERC20 name and symbol
        └── it should set owner to provided address
